      "content": "thanks for that. so if the mainstream critique is mainly about environment vs genetics, do the race-realist proponents have a counter-argument for why environmental factors like socioeconomic status or schooling can't fully explain the gaps they see in the IQ data? like, do they claim there's a biological floor or ceiling for certain groups?",
